OL,3,GNEWSAHow do you move a museum (and one
OL,4,Alarge lion)?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFragile fossils, tropical fish, and a
OL,7,Ftaxidermied lion called Wallace are
OL,8,Famong a trove of items being packed up
OL,9,Fby a museum before its renovation.
OL,11,FSunderland Museum and Winter Gardens
OL,12,Fcloses to visitors on 29 August ahead
OL,13,Fof a #13.6m upgrade, with its
OL,14,Fcollection being toured and loaned
OL,15,Facross the city until the premises
OL,16,Freopen in late 2028.
OL,18,FBut how do you move a museum's
OL,19,Fcollection of some 108,000 objects
OL,20,Fwithout losing anything?
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
